{"repositoryId":1296691740,"availability":"available","full":"Yudaotor/lyrimuse","name":"lyrimuse","description":"Mac lyrics app: word-by-word synced lyrics for Apple Music, Spotify, YouTube Music, QQ Music, NetEase Cloud Music, Kugou and more. Floating desktop lyrics, notch / Dynamic Island, menu bar and Touch Bar; translation, romanization, Last.fm scrobbling, Discord. Open-source LyricsX alternative. | Mac 桌面歌词：QQ音乐、网易云、酷狗、汽水音乐逐字歌词，灵动岛、翻译、粤拼，LyricsX 替代","category":"Other","language":"Swift","stars":250,"forks":11,"created":"2026-07-10T16:23:05Z","updated":"2026-10-15T01:15:56Z","license":"GPL-3.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://yudaotor.github.io/lyrimuse/","topics":["amazon-music","apple-music","desktop-lyrics","dynamic-island","kkbox","kugou","lastfm","lyrics","macos","menu-bar-app","menubar","netease-cloud-music","qq-music","scrobbler","spotify","spotify-lyrics","synced-lyrics","touch-bar","word-by-word","youtube-music"],"demo":"https://yudaotor.github.io/lyrimuse/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T18:03:45.212Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-15T18:03:45.212Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-15T18:03:45.212Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-15T18:03:45.212Z","stars":250,"forks":11}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Lyrimuse is an open-source desktop lyrics app for macOS. It lives in the menu bar and highlights lyrics word by word as the song plays: floating always on top of your windows, in the menu bar, in a Dynamic-Island-style capsule under the notch, on the Touch Bar, or in a full lyrics window. It works with nine players, including Apple Music, Spotify, Amazon Music and the YouTube Music app Kaset, plus web players in your browser, and picks the best match from twelve lyrics sources, with translation and romanization when you want them. It also keeps a Last.fm listening profile and scrobbles your…","Coming from LyricsX? It hasn't had a new release since April 2022. Lyrimuse covers what it did, keeps getting updates, and adds support for Chinese-language players, KKBOX, Amazon Music, Kaset and web players. For the details, see the fact-checked comparison with LyricsX and Lyric Fever.","Four ways to show lyrics: the Lyrics Window, the Dynamic-Island-style capsule, the floating overlay with word-by-word highlight, and the menu bar"],"features":["Where every feature lives in Settings, and whether it is on or off after you install: see the feature list.","Word-by-word highlighting that keeps up with the song as it plays.","Twelve lyrics sources, searched for you: NetEase Cloud Music, QQ Music, Kugou, Kuwo, Migu, Musixmatch, LRCLIB, LyricFind (through YouTube Music), Deezer, AMLL (a hand-curated word-by-word lyrics database), Soda Music…","Translation and romanization under the original lyrics. If the source has a community translation, you get that. If not, turn on System Fallback Translation in Settings (it's off by default) and your Mac translates the…","Duets split by singer. When the source (or an AMLL entry) marks who sings which line, each part is shown on its own instead of two voices mashed into one block."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Yudaotor/lyrimuse/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"dabe126ff03df11f58be22e9afe70fd36212e2210fa5cbe62490f09adde15b76","extractedAt":"2026-10-15T18:03:45.335Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T18:03:45.335Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Lyrimuse is an open-source desktop lyrics app for macOS. It lives in the menu bar and highlights lyrics word by word as the song plays: floating always on top of your windows, in the menu bar, in a Dynamic-Island-style capsule under the notch, on the Touch Bar, or in a full lyrics window. It works with nine players, including Apple Music, Spotify, Amazon Music and the YouTube Music app Kaset, plus web players in your browser, and picks the best match from twelve lyrics sources, with translation and romanization when you want them. It also keeps a Last.fm listening profile and scrobbles your…","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Yudaotor/lyrimuse/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"paid_service","status":"required","text":"Apple Music's lyrics need a subscription, and many of its tracks have word timing.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Yudaotor/lyrimuse/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"You don't need to connect a Spotify account.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Yudaotor/lyrimuse/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"paid_service","status":"required","text":"There's no paid version, no in-app purchase and no account to sign up for.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Yudaotor/lyrimuse/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"There's no paid version, no in-app purchase and no account to sign up for.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Yudaotor/lyrimuse/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"dabe126ff03df11f58be22e9afe70fd36212e2210fa5cbe62490f09adde15b76","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Yudaotor/lyrimuse/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-15T18:03:45.336Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-15T01:15:56Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Yudaotor/lyrimuse/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-15T18:03:45.338Z","hash":"dabe126ff03df11f58be22e9afe70fd36212e2210fa5cbe62490f09adde15b76","originalBytes":44023,"storedBytes":44023,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["music","lyrics","apple","lyrimuse","song","one","app","when","album","artist","only","own","player","settings","mac","open","page","spotify","every","line","macos","youtube","web","bar","netease","any","install","kaset","last.fm","once","soda","them","translation","menu","which","amazon","how","same","show","cloud","cover","like","get","players","there","window","brew","does","each","intel","kkbox","other","see","timing","already","chinese","kugou","listenbrainz","shows","what","word-by-word","applications","capsule","click","lyric","need","off","playin